{"name": "ScrapWings", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565660/extras/d9545aa046eeed09be689092552c6bc7.avif?t=1785586891\" width=\"1280\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore</strong> the surrounding desert and use the grappling hook to bring scrap metal back to base. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Races against the clock</strong> await to test your piloting skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fight in the skies</strong> and complete pirate missions with varied objectives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perform well and <strong>earn medals</strong> in races and missions, and unlock new crafting recipes to equip your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565660/extras/868ecdf56833863c8456f1672d328273.avif?t=1785586891\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565660/extras/41b8d69497eb6ad49c7e71cab62cbebb.webp?t=1785586891\" width=\"40\"/></span>\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565660/extras/41b8d69497eb6ad49c7e71cab62cbebb.webp?t=1785586891\" width=\"40\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Solo dev project</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565660/extras/41b8d69497eb6ad49c7e71cab62cbebb.webp?t=1785586891\" width=\"40\"/></span>\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565660/extras/41b8d69497eb6ad49c7e71cab62cbebb.webp?t=1785586891\" width=\"40\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Behind Scrap Wings is a very small team: a developer wearing several hats with a good dose of motivation! This is my very first game released on Steam, so please add it to your wishlist to show your support =).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Fight the Consortium's armada aboard your junkyard ship in an old-school flight simulator setting. Unlock new equipment recipes as you progress and build your aircraft of legend.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565660/101da219ad45309051dea97894aa706308bda969/header.jpg?t=1785586891", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Simulation", "Flight", "Controller", "Steampunk", "Cartoony", "3D"], "developers": "AmadeusCraft", "publishers": "AmadeusCraft", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3565660", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "17 April 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/EW_oKUcIuGo", "first_seen": 1744840800.0, "review_rank": 1721}